d up to two more beds. Crib possible. Breakfast must be ordered <u>separately</u>. The max lines is set to three and all over are invisible. Hover with your mouse or push with a finger on your mobile device on the text to show all lines.\n    \t\t\t\t\t</p>\n    \t\t\t\t</div>\n    \t\t\t\t<div className=\"flex flex-row py-3 px-4 border-t border-gray-100 dark:!border-gray-600\">\n    \t\t\t\t\t<div className=\"w-1/2 flex flex-row dark400\">\n    \t\t\t\t\t\t<span className=\"mr-1\">$</span>\n    \t\t\t\t\t\t<span>149.00 ¬ Night</span>\n    \t\t\t\t\t</div>\n    \t\t\t\t\t<div className=\"w-1/2 text-yellow-400 text-end font-semibold\">\n    \t\t\t\t\t\t☆☆☆☆☆\n    \t\t\t\t\t</div>\n    \t\t\t\t</div>\n    \t\t\t</div>\n    \t\t</div>\n    \t</div>\n    </div>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n",
